WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
You go get the key and I look around.

2
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,700
Can you give me this?

3
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:19,100
You make me feel so comfortable, classmate

4
00:00:19,340 --> 00:00:22,300
How can I reward you?

5
00:00:35,210 --> 00:00:36,850
That Weiyang Xuemei

6
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:40,090
Have you contacted your family?

7
00:00:40,750 --> 00:00:43,070
I called my family more than a dozen times but no one answered.

8
00:00:43,350 --> 00:00:44,790
The most important thing for us now is

9
00:00:45,030 --> 00:00:46,430
Get out of here alive first

10
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:47,750
Only then do I have the heart to think about those things

11
00:00:47,750 --> 00:00:48,870
Also

12
00:00:49,230 --> 00:00:52,090
Where should we tie it? We tie it outside the window

13
00:00:52,810 --> 00:00:54,570
It's not high enough if tied inside.

14
00:00:54,570 --> 00:00:56,170
We might get hurt if we go down

15
00:00:56,170 --> 00:00:57,650
Tie to the outer bracket

16
00:00:57,650 --> 00:00:59,530
It's just over two meters above the ground

17
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:01,650
It would be better if the chance of injury is better

18
00:01:02,050 --> 00:01:03,130
Let me tie you up, Xue Mei
